cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Specula in research or in your organisation, please cite it."
title: "Specula: threat-informed CVE prioritisation"
abstract: >-
  An explainable Cyber Threat Intelligence pipeline that narrows every published CVE to the ones
  that matter to one organisation, using owned assets, third-party suppliers and an adversary
  threat profile (CISA KEV, FIRST EPSS, MITRE ATT&CK, CTID), with SSVC decision tiers and STIX 2.1 output.
authors:
  - family-names: Johal
    given-names: Diljot Singh
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
keywords: [cyber threat intelligence, vulnerability management, CVE, EPSS, KEV, MITRE ATT&CK, STIX, SSVC]
